T* () Tj
T* (BECKER, Chief Judge.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This civil action was brought in the District Court for the) Tj
T* (District of New Jersey by a consortium of media groups) Tj
T* (seeking access to "special interest" deportation hearings) Tj
T* (involving persons whom the Attorney General has) Tj
T* (determined might have connections to or knowledge of the) Tj
T* (September 11, 2001 terrorist attacks. This category was) Tj
T* (created by a directive issued by Michael Creppy, the Chief) Tj
T* (United States Immigration Judge, outlining additional) Tj
T* (security measures to be applied in this class of cases,) Tj
T* (including closing hearings to the public and the press.) Tj
T* (Named as defendants in the suit were Attorney General) Tj
T* (John Ashcroft and Chief Judge Creppy. The District Court) Tj
T* (found for the media plaintiffs and issued an order enjoining) Tj
T* (the Attorney General from denying access, from which he) Tj
T* (now appeals.) Tj
