T* (dramatically. The era that dawned on September 11th, and) Tj
T* (the war against terrorism that has pervaded the sinews of) Tj
T* (our national life since that day, are reflected in thousands) Tj
T* (of ways in legislative and national policy, the habits of daily) Tj
T* (living, and our collective psyches. Since the primary) Tj
T* (national policy must be self-preservation, it seems) Tj
T* (elementary that, to the extent open deportation hearings) Tj
T* (might impair national security, that security is implicated) Tj
T* (in the logic test. When it is factored in, given due) Tj
T* (consideration to the attorney general's statements of the) Tj
T* (threat, we do not believe that the Richmond Newspapers) Tj
T* (logic prong test favors the media either.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (As we will now explain in detail, we find that the) Tj
T* (application of the Richmond Newspapers experience and) Tj
T* (logic tests does not compel us to declare the Creppy) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (                                7) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Directive unconstitutional. We will therefore reverse the) Tj
T* (Order of the District Court.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (I. BACKGROUND) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (A. The Creppy Directive) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Shortly after the attacks of September 11, 2001, the) Tj
T* (President ordered a worldwide investigation into those) Tj
T* (atrocities and related terrorist threats to the United States.) Tj
T* (Over the course of this ongoing investigation, the) Tj
T* (government has become aware of numerous aliens who are) Tj
T* (subject to removal from the United States for violating) Tj
T* (immigration laws. The Immigration and Naturalization) Tj
T* (Service has detained and initiated removal proceedings) Tj
T* (against many of these individuals.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The Department of Justice, which oversees the INS, has) Tj
T* (identified some aliens whose situations are particularly) Tj
T* (sensitive and designated their hearings "special interest") Tj
T* (cases. According to Dale L. Watson, the FBI's Executive) Tj
T* (Assistant Director for Counterterrorism and) Tj
T* (Counterintelligence, the designated aliens "might have) Tj
T* (connections with, or possess information pertaining to,) Tj
T* (terrorist activities against the United States." \(Watson Dec.\)) Tj
T* (For example, special interest cases include aliens who had) Tj
T* (close associations with the September 11 hijackers or who) Tj
T* (themselves have associated with al Qaeda or related) Tj
T* (terrorist groups.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The Department of Justice has reviewed these) Tj
T* (designations periodically and removed them in many cases) Tj
T* (that it determined were less sensitive than previously) Tj
T* (believed. For those cases that retain the "special interest") Tj
T* (designation, however, Chief Immigration Judge Creppy) Tj
T* (issued a memorandum \(the "Creppy Directive"\)) Tj
T* (implementing heightened security measures.1 The Directive) Tj
